# Tienda de Ciudad Cenit (C6, contract 49, interior, Mart): the shopkeeper behind the counter; the shop opens at once: `shop ciudad_cenit` (shop 13). Same layout as the Ambar one.
@map tienda_cenit
@size 9 7
@interior yes
@bg 3
@fill floor_wood
@spawn door 4 5 N
@legend
  .  tile=floor_wood
  a  tile=none object=wall_corner
  b  tile=none object=wall_j
  c  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  d  tile=none object=wall_i
  e  tile=floor_wood object=shelf
  f  tile=floor_wood npc=tendero id=clerk face=SW script=clerk
  g  tile=floor_wood object=counter
  h  tile=mat
@grid
  abcbbbcbb
  d.eee.ee.
  d...f....
  d.ggg....
  d.......e
  d........
  d...hh...
@warp h -> ciudad_cenit spawn=tienda_door
@script clerk npc
    shop ciudad_cenit
@end
